      "type": "text",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 372,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 45,
      "text": "guid = SHA256(canonical_url)   published_at → UTC\nStrip HTML → summary, keep raw → content_html\nExtract authors, image_url, tags, language",
