      "x": 215,
      "y": 722,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "1. Redis SET NX  SHA256(guid+source_id)  TTL=24h  → fast pre-check (skip if exists)\n2. Postgres SELECT WHERE content_hash=$1  → authoritative check before INSERT",
