    {
      "id": "text-cluster-detail",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 988,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "1. Consume article.created from Redis Stream\n2. POST title+summary[0:200] → Embedder sidecar → float[384]\n3. pgvector ANN: nearest 5 clusters WHERE last_seen > now-48h\n4. If cosine_sim > 0.82 → merge:\n     • Update centroid = (old_centroid × n + new_vec) / (n+1)\n     • Increment article_count, source_count, last_seen_at\n     • Replace headline if new source has higher authority\n5. Else → INSERT new story_cluster (seed with this article)\n6. Write cluster_articles join row",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeColor": "#4A1F9A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "version": 47,
      "versionNonce": 185438306,
      "index": "ay",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780854567835,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Consume article.created from Redis Stream\n2. POST title+summary[0:200] → Embedder sidecar → float[384]\n3. pgvector ANN: nearest 5 clusters WHERE last_seen > now-48h\n4. If cosine_sim > 0.82 → merge:\n     • Update centroid = (old_centroid × n + new_vec) / (n+1)\n     • Increment article_count, source_count, last_seen_at\n     • Replace headline if new source has higher authority\n5. Else → INSERT new story_cluster (seed with this article)\n6. Write cluster_articles join row",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2037037037037037
    },
